**Credit office guidance, returns to private pay — Private Pay Long-Term Care Residency.** The resumption deposit days follow the agreement's payment record over the last twelve months (entries dated fewer than twelve whole calendar months before the day the resumption deposit is worked out):

- at least 2 payments on the agreement dishonored — 2 being the returned-payment limit in every tier: **60 days**, the days set for an agreement on certified funds;
- fewer dishonored, and a late charge assessed on the agreement: **45 days**, the days set for an agreement with a recent late charge;
- neither: the security deposit days of the agreement's tier, **30 days** in every tier.

**Hypothetical cases.** One dishonored payment and one late charge in the window: 45. Three dishonored payments: 60. A late charge assessed 12 whole months and a few days back, nothing else: 30.
